art","command_ids":["cmd-2a530e688a2b4f21","cmd-b0c006fcd9f0499f"],"summary":"Post-restart: service enabled+active with new MainPID 738 (previously 1307), worker.log continued appending new ticks while retaining pre-restart entries, confirming both service and data recovery"}]},"ttft_ms":1594,"type":"result","duration_ms":90707,"uuid":"57c3549f-9405-42c1-be7c-8ffce42e8dfa","ttft_stream_ms":731,"time_to_request_ms":61,"first_content_frame_ms":731,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
